# Binaries
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
# `go build ./...` from the repo root writes one output binary per main
# package into cwd when no -o is given — cmd/cli is the only main package,
# so that binary lands here as a plain, extension-less "cli".
/cli

